d more to basically every aspect of the game. Game is growing with each update and updates come steadily as planned. Starting to feel one of the best games what you get per $ spent. \n\nOne thing that could be added is melee dodge or block mechanics like in Vermintide. Fighting is completely gunplay/prevent anything getting too close / try to keep distance. Also the phasing is slower (and different) than in Vermintide. But all in all DRG and Vermintide are different games. I like them both.\n\nUpdate 25 end game content: simply...yes, more beards and beer", "timestamp_created": 1534355702, "timestamp_updated": 1574881945, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44163491", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037694520", "personaname": "Skipper", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037694520/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 24595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2937, "last_played": 1700401153, "avatar": "5237dccc1e9714fc8b6723506810ee97853974cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Un excellent jeu de coop qui change des survival de zombie, un peu drôle et un vrai plaisir à jouer.", "timestamp_created": 1534332127, "timestamp_updated": 1534332127, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514787435531616211", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44154840", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070660834", "personaname": "Tiago", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_